                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "EUQEU",
                                  "fill": "#1A202C",
                                  "content": "Auth bypass in OAuth callback state validation",
                                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                  "fontSize": 18,
                                  "fontWeight": "700"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "2Tv3Y",
                                  "fill": "#4A5568",
                                  "content": "src/web/routes/auth.rs:142  •  CWE-352  •  confidence 0.94",
                                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                  "fontSize": 12,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "UeGO9",
                              "fill": "#F5F7FA",
                              "cornerRadius": 8,
                              "padding": [
                                8,
                                10
                              ],
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "nj1sb",
                                  "fill": "#1A202C",
                                  "content": "Open",
                                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                  "fontSize": 11,
                                  "fontWeight": "600"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "aLjWE",
                          "fill": "#4A5568",
                          "content": "A redirect edge case lets the callback accept a stale or mismatched state token, which can pin a victim into an attacker-controlled session context.",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 12,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "C0yWv",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "fill": "#FFFFFF",
                      "cornerRadius": 8,
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 10,
                      "padding": [
                        18,
                        20
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "yIF6d",
                          "fill": "#1A202C",
                          "content": "Explanation",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "700"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "r7vBR",
                          "fill": "#4A5568",
                          "content": "The login callback trusts state too late in the flow. If the session already contains an OAuth context and the callback returns early, the handler can complete without re-validating the original state challenge. That breaks a core CSRF defense in the OAuth dance.",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 12,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "mW6W5",
                      "width": "fill_container",
